{"4141230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Space Delivery", "steam_appid": 4141230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Delivery is a <strong>co-op survival horror game </strong>focused on <strong>extraction and item collection</strong>. Players must work together to meet a weekly profit quota by traveling to different planets and dimensions to recover lost cargo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a backpack where items must be stacked, the team faces a difficult task: every destination features unique challenges, enemies, traps, and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/e75949dd34670f6be22e5806b05bf0a1.poster.avif?t=1787667169\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/e75949dd34670f6be22e5806b05bf0a1.webm?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/e75949dd34670f6be22e5806b05bf0a1.mp4?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>STORY &amp; PREMISE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of the &quot;<strong>Lost Cargo Division</strong>,&quot; a team tasked with recovering shipments that were misplaced by buyers across the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of the mission, you are assigned a financial quota that must be met within 5 days. If you succeed, the quota increases for the next week, as does the overall difficulty of the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/dba0c215cdd3590a9e4b4207d5531382.poster.avif?t=1787667169\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/dba0c215cdd3590a9e4b4207d5531382.webm?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/dba0c215cdd3590a9e4b4207d5531382.mp4?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PROXIMITY VOICE CHAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication is vital, but dangerous. The game features a Positional Voice Chat system where enemies can hear players speaking. While the game includes combat, stealth is often the smarter choice. Weapons are loud, and the entities are drawn to noise, including your team's voice chat. This creates high-tension moments where silence is a survival mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/400d24d1953bd247ee81a53a46d03f2f.poster.avif?t=1787667169\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/400d24d1953bd247ee81a53a46d03f2f.webm?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/400d24d1953bd247ee81a53a46d03f2f.mp4?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>INFINITE REPLAYABILITY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two matches are the same</strong>. The replay factor is driven by deep procedural generation and dynamic systems, ensuring players always face a fresh experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/b00d224aafb0800ccc1105170d34c004.poster.avif?t=1787667169\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/b00d224aafb0800ccc1105170d34c004.webm?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/b00d224aafb0800ccc1105170d34c004.mp4?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROCEDURAL LEVELS &amp; HAZARDS</strong><br><br>All scenarios are generated procedurally with various themes. Each level introduces a new environmental challenge: some have unique traps or holes, others are swarming with enemies, and some have strict time limits due to oxygen levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSICS-BASED GAMEPLAY</strong><br><br>Inventory management is tactile and strategic. Players must stack &quot;Lost Cargo&quot; on their backs, and <strong>every item has active physics</strong>. Movement matters—<strong>bumping into another player can knock over their stack.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items are <strong>explosive or radioactive</strong>, and all <strong>cargo loses monetary value if it takes damage</strong>, adding a layer of chaotic fun to the extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADAPTIVE ENEMIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are distinct enemies, each with a unique visual design and behavior pattern. Players must constantly adapt their strategies to survive these encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROGRESSION &amp; ECONOMY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br>Risk leads to reward. The ship features a shop where players can spend their bonuses on items, weapons, consumables, cosmetic suits, and ship upgrades. The shop is dynamic: items go on sale, stock runs out, and inventory is replenished only after meeting the quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't forget to Add to your Wishlist ;)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/38d008b9f839bb9a11d6e40c408664cf.poster.avif?t=1787667169\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/38d008b9f839bb9a11d6e40c408664cf.webm?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/38d008b9f839bb9a11d6e40c408664cf.mp4?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Delivery is a <strong>co-op survival horror game </strong>focused on <strong>extraction and item collection</strong>. Players must work together to meet a weekly profit quota by traveling to different planets and dimensions to recover lost cargo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a backpack where items must be stacked, the team faces a difficult task: every destination features unique challenges, enemies, traps, and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/e75949dd34670f6be22e5806b05bf0a1.poster.avif?t=1787667169\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/e75949dd34670f6be22e5806b05bf0a1.webm?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/e75949dd34670f6be22e5806b05bf0a1.mp4?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>STORY &amp; PREMISE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are part of the &quot;<strong>Lost Cargo Division</strong>,&quot; a team tasked with recovering shipments that were misplaced by buyers across the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of the mission, you are assigned a financial quota that must be met within 5 days. If you succeed, the quota increases for the next week, as does the overall difficulty of the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/dba0c215cdd3590a9e4b4207d5531382.poster.avif?t=1787667169\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/dba0c215cdd3590a9e4b4207d5531382.webm?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/dba0c215cdd3590a9e4b4207d5531382.mp4?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PROXIMITY VOICE CHAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communication is vital, but dangerous. The game features a Positional Voice Chat system where enemies can hear players speaking. While the game includes combat, stealth is often the smarter choice. Weapons are loud, and the entities are drawn to noise, including your team's voice chat. This creates high-tension moments where silence is a survival mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/400d24d1953bd247ee81a53a46d03f2f.poster.avif?t=1787667169\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/400d24d1953bd247ee81a53a46d03f2f.webm?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/400d24d1953bd247ee81a53a46d03f2f.mp4?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>INFINITE REPLAYABILITY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two matches are the same</strong>. The replay factor is driven by deep procedural generation and dynamic systems, ensuring players always face a fresh experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/b00d224aafb0800ccc1105170d34c004.poster.avif?t=1787667169\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/b00d224aafb0800ccc1105170d34c004.webm?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/b00d224aafb0800ccc1105170d34c004.mp4?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROCEDURAL LEVELS &amp; HAZARDS</strong><br><br>All scenarios are generated procedurally with various themes. Each level introduces a new environmental challenge: some have unique traps or holes, others are swarming with enemies, and some have strict time limits due to oxygen levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHYSICS-BASED GAMEPLAY</strong><br><br>Inventory management is tactile and strategic. Players must stack &quot;Lost Cargo&quot; on their backs, and <strong>every item has active physics</strong>. Movement matters—<strong>bumping into another player can knock over their stack.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items are <strong>explosive or radioactive</strong>, and all <strong>cargo loses monetary value if it takes damage</strong>, adding a layer of chaotic fun to the extraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADAPTIVE ENEMIES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are distinct enemies, each with a unique visual design and behavior pattern. Players must constantly adapt their strategies to survive these encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PROGRESSION &amp; ECONOMY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br>Risk leads to reward. The ship features a shop where players can spend their bonuses on items, weapons, consumables, cosmetic suits, and ship upgrades. The shop is dynamic: items go on sale, stock runs out, and inventory is replenished only after meeting the quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't forget to Add to your Wishlist ;)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/38d008b9f839bb9a11d6e40c408664cf.poster.avif?t=1787667169\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/38d008b9f839bb9a11d6e40c408664cf.webm?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/extras/38d008b9f839bb9a11d6e40c408664cf.mp4?t=1787667169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Grab your crew for a high-stakes co-op horror run. You have 5 days to meet the quota. Haul valuable and dangerous, cargo from procedural levels and surreal, shifting dimensions. Survive deadly entities and daily Galactic Events. Get paid. Get upgraded. Survive the week.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/1255629b00f5046f27febb05def5544f261c13f3/header.jpg?t=1787667169", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/d56b1d5271d816bc8074eeca3a895b95bed88582/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787667169", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141230/d56b1d5271d816bc8074eeca3a895b95bed88582/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787667169", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 8100 or Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 2GB or RX 560 2GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not Supported</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stron